    accTitle: From My Kitchen browser architecture
    accDescr: Next.js supplies the React view with the recipe and site language. A Redux Toolkit store and TypeScript scaling engine update ingredient quantities locally. Bundled messages localize the interface and catalog records supply ingredient names. The browser can translate cook-authored text on device using the Translator API. Source language comes from detection, local language cues, or the reader's choice. Original text remains available when translation cannot run.

